' Hierarchy & Conformance
Coordinator <|.. AppCoordinator
Coordinator <|.. CatalogCoordinator
Coordinator <|.. CheckoutCoordinator

CatalogCoordinatorProtocol <|.. CatalogCoordinator
CheckoutCoordinatorProtocol <|.. CheckoutCoordinator
CatalogCoordinatorDelegate <|.. AppCoordinator

' App Level Wiring
AppContainerView --> AppCoordinator : observes
AppCoordinator *-- CatalogCoordinator : owns child
AppCoordinator *-- CheckoutCoordinator : owns child
AppCoordinator --> AppTab : controls selectedTab
CatalogCoordinator --> CatalogCoordinatorDelegate : communicates via delegate

' Router Bindings
AppCoordinator --> NavigationRouter : has root router
CatalogCoordinator *-- NavigationRouter : owns dedicated router
CheckoutCoordinator *-- NavigationRouter : owns dedicated router

' Container View NavigationStack Bindings
CatalogContainerView --> CatalogCoordinator : observes
CatalogContainerView ..> NavigationRouter : binds '$coordinator.router.path' to NavigationStack
CheckoutContainerView --> CheckoutCoordinator : observes
CheckoutContainerView ..> NavigationRouter : binds '$coordinator.router.path' to NavigationStack

' Route & Factory Connections
CatalogCoordinator --> CatalogRoute : builds view for
CheckoutCoordinator --> CheckoutRoute : builds view for

' Catalog Presentation Wiring
CatalogContainerView ..> ProductListView : renders root
CatalogViewModel --> CatalogCoordinatorProtocol : invokes navigation
ProductListView --> CatalogViewModel : user events
ProductDetailView --> CatalogCoordinatorProtocol : invokes proceedToCheckout
CatalogCoordinator ..> ProductListView : builds
CatalogCoordinator ..> ProductDetailView : builds

' Checkout Presentation Wiring
CheckoutContainerView ..> CheckoutInputView : renders root
CheckoutInputViewModel --> CheckoutCoordinatorProtocol : invokes navigation
DiscountViewModel --> CheckoutCoordinatorProtocol : invokes navigation
PaymentViewModel --> CheckoutCoordinatorProtocol : invokes navigation
CheckoutCoordinator ..> CheckoutInputView : builds
CheckoutCoordinator ..> DiscountView : builds
CheckoutCoordinator ..> PaymentView : builds
CheckoutCoordinator ..> ReceiptView : builds

@enduml

@startuml NavigationFlows
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2C3E50
    ActorBorderColor #2C3E50
    LifeLineBorderColor #2C3E50
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #EBF5FB
    ParticipantBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBackgroundColor White
    BoxBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
    BoxBorderColor #BDC3C7
}

header MVVM-C Navigation Flow Traces
title Navigation Interactions: Intra-Feature, Cross-Feature & Unwinding

actor User
box "Root / App Orchestration" #FAF0E6
    participant "AppContainerView\n(TabView)" as AppView
    participant "AppCoordinator\n(@Observable)" as AppCoord
end box

box "Catalog Feature (Module 1)" #EBF5FB
    participant "CatalogContainerView\n(NavigationStack)" as CatStack
    participant "ProductListView" as ListUI
    participant "CatalogViewModel" as CatVM
    participant "CatalogCoordinator" as CatCoord
    participant "ProductDetailView" as DetailUI
end box

box "Core Navigation Infrastructure" #F5EEF8
    participant "Catalog Router\n(NavigationRouter)" as CatRouter
    participant "Catalog Path\n(NavigationPath)" as CatPath
    participant "Checkout Router\n(NavigationRouter)" as CheckRouter
    participant "Checkout Path\n(NavigationPath)" as CheckPath
end box

box "Checkout Feature (Module 2)" #FDF2E9
    participant "CheckoutCoordinator" as CheckCoord
    participant "CheckoutContainerView\n(NavigationStack)" as CheckStack
    participant "DiscountViewModel" as DiscVM
    participant "DiscountView" as DiscUI
    participant "PaymentViewModel" as PayVM
    participant "PaymentView" as PayUI
    participant "ReceiptView" as ReceiptUI
end box

== Scenario 1: Intra-Feature Navigation (Push & Pop via Router) ==

User -> ListUI: Taps product card (e.g. "iPhone 15")
ListUI -> CatVM: selectProduct(product)
activate CatVM
CatVM -> CatCoord: showProductDetail(product) [via CatalogCoordinatorProtocol]
deactivate CatVM

activate CatCoord
CatCoord -> CatRouter: push(CatalogRoute.productDetail(product))
activate CatRouter
CatRouter -> CatPath: append(CatalogRoute.productDetail(product))
deactivate CatRouter

note over CatRouter, CatStack
  **Observation & Two-Way Binding:**
  CatStack holds 'NavigationStack(path: $coordinator.router.path)'.
  Appending to CatPath notifies SwiftUI.
end note

CatPath --> CatStack: Path updated with [.productDetail(product)]
CatStack -> CatCoord: buildView(for: .productDetail(product))
CatCoord -> DetailUI: instantiates ProductDetailView(product, coordinator: self)
CatCoord --> CatStack: returns DetailUI View
deactivate CatCoord
CatStack --> User: Animates push transition to ProductDetailView

alt Native iOS Gesture Pop or Navigation Back Button
    User -> DetailUI: Swipes edge / Taps Navigation Bar "< Back"
    DetailUI -> CatPath: SwiftUI automatically removes last element
    CatPath --> CatStack: Path updated to []
    CatStack --> User: Animates pop back to ProductListView
end

== Scenario 2: Cross-Feature Navigation (Delegate Contract & Tab Switching) ==

User -> DetailUI: Taps "Add to Cart & Checkout" button
DetailUI -> CatCoord: proceedToCheckout(with: product) [CatalogCoordinatorProtocol]
activate CatCoord
CatCoord -> AppCoord: catalogDidSelectProductForCheckout(product) [CatalogCoordinatorDelegate]
deactivate CatCoord

note over CatCoord, AppCoord
  **Strict Clean Architecture Decoupling:**
  Catalog Feature has ZERO knowledge of Checkout Feature.
  Communication happens strictly through Delegate interface.
end note

activate AppCoord
AppCoord -> AppCoord: Transform Product -> Order(items: [item], subtotal: price)
AppCoord -> AppView: Set selectedTab = .checkout
AppView --> User: Active tab switches to Checkout Tab

AppCoord -> CheckCoord: showDiscount(for: order)
deactivate AppCoord

activate CheckCoord
CheckCoord -> CheckRouter: push(CheckoutRoute.discount(order))
activate CheckRouter
CheckRouter -> CheckPath: append(CheckoutRoute.discount(order))
deactivate CheckRouter

CheckPath --> CheckStack: Path updated with [.discount(order)]
CheckStack -> CheckCoord: buildView(for: .discount(order))
CheckCoord -> DiscVM: instantiates DiscountViewModel(order, coordinator, useCase)
CheckCoord -> DiscUI: instantiates DiscountView(viewModel)
CheckCoord --> CheckStack: returns DiscUI View
deactivate CheckCoord
CheckStack --> User: Displays DiscountView (Checkout tab)

== Scenario 3: Flow Progression & Reset (Pop to Root) ==

User -> DiscUI: Enters promo code and taps "Proceed to Payment"
DiscUI -> DiscVM: skipOrProceedToPayment()
activate DiscVM
DiscVM -> CheckCoord: showPayment(for: order, discount: discount) [CheckoutCoordinatorProtocol]
deactivate DiscVM

activate CheckCoord
CheckCoord -> CheckRouter: push(CheckoutRoute.payment(order, discount))
activate CheckRouter
CheckRouter -> CheckPath: append(CheckoutRoute.payment(order, discount))
deactivate CheckRouter

CheckPath --> CheckStack: Path updated with [.discount, .payment]
CheckStack -> CheckCoord: buildView(for: .payment(order, discount))
CheckCoord -> PayVM: instantiates PaymentViewModel(order, discount, coordinator, useCase)
CheckCoord -> PayUI: instantiates PaymentView(viewModel)
CheckCoord --> CheckStack: returns PayUI View
deactivate CheckCoord
CheckStack --> User: Displays PaymentView

User -> PayUI: Taps "Confirm & Pay Now"
PayUI -> PayVM: processPayment()
activate PayVM
PayVM -> PayVM: Executes payment use case (PaymentResult)
PayVM -> CheckCoord: showSuccess(result: paymentResult) [CheckoutCoordinatorProtocol]
deactivate PayVM

activate CheckCoord
CheckCoord -> Router: push(CheckoutRoute.success(result))
activate CheckRouter
CheckRouter -> CheckPath: append(CheckoutRoute.success(result))
deactivate CheckRouter

CheckPath --> CheckStack: Path updated with [.discount, .payment, .success]
CheckStack -> CheckCoord: buildView(for: .success(result))
CheckCoord -> ReceiptUI: instantiates ReceiptView(result, onDone: finishCheckout)
CheckCoord --> CheckStack: returns ReceiptUI View
deactivate CheckCoord
CheckStack --> User: Displays ReceiptView with confirmation

User -> ReceiptUI: Taps "Done" button
ReceiptUI -> CheckCoord: onDone() -> finishCheckout()
activate CheckCoord
CheckCoord -> CheckRouter: popToRoot()
activate CheckRouter
CheckRouter -> CheckPath: path = NavigationPath() (clears stack)
deactivate CheckRouter

CheckPath --> CheckStack: Path updated to []
CheckStack --> User: SwiftUI smoothly unwinds entire stack to root CheckoutInputView
deactivate CheckCoord

@enduml

@startuml NavigationStateTransitions
skinparam backgroundColor White
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor White
    BorderColor #2C3E50
    ArrowColor #2C3E50
}

header MVVM-C Navigation State Machine
title NavigationPath Stack States & Transitions Across Features

[*] --> CatalogFlow

state "Catalog Navigation Flow (Tab .catalog)" as CatalogFlow #EBF5FB {
    state "Catalog Root" as CatRoot {
        CatRoot : **Screen:** ProductListView
        CatRoot : **NavigationPath:** [] (Empty)
        CatRoot : **Triggered By:** CatalogContainerView init
    }

    state "Product Detail" as CatDetail {
        CatDetail : **Screen:** ProductDetailView
        CatDetail : **NavigationPath:** [.productDetail(Product)]
        CatDetail : **Triggered By:** coordinator.showProductDetail(product)
        CatDetail : **Factory:** coordinator.buildView(for: .productDetail)
    }

    CatRoot --> CatDetail : User taps product card\nVM invokes coordinator.showProductDetail\nRouter appends .productDetail(product)
    CatDetail --> CatRoot : User swipes back or taps Back button\nSwiftUI pops last route from NavigationPath
}

state "Checkout Navigation Flow (Tab .checkout)" as CheckoutFlow #FDF2E9 {
    state "Checkout Root" as CheckRoot {
        CheckRoot : **Screen:** CheckoutInputView
        CheckRoot : **NavigationPath:** [] (Empty)
        CheckRoot : **Triggered By:** CheckoutContainerView init / Tab select
    }

    state "Discount Step" as CheckDiscount {
        CheckDiscount : **Screen:** DiscountView
        CheckDiscount : **NavigationPath:** [.discount(Order)]
        CheckDiscount : **Triggered By:** coordinator.showDiscount(for: order)
        CheckDiscount : **Factory:** coordinator.buildView(for: .discount)
    }

    state "Payment Step" as CheckPayment {
        CheckPayment : **Screen:** PaymentView
        CheckPayment : **NavigationPath:** [.discount, .payment(Order, Discount?)]
        CheckPayment : **Triggered By:** coordinator.showPayment(for: order, discount)
        CheckPayment : **Factory:** coordinator.buildView(for: .payment)
    }

    state "Receipt Step" as CheckReceipt {
        CheckReceipt : **Screen:** ReceiptView
        CheckReceipt : **NavigationPath:** [.discount, .payment, .success(PaymentResult)]
        CheckReceipt : **Triggered By:** coordinator.showSuccess(result)
        CheckReceipt : **Factory:** coordinator.buildView(for: .success)
    }

    CheckRoot --> CheckDiscount : Standalone flow:\nUser enters item info & taps "Proceed"\nVM calls coordinator.showDiscount
    CheckDiscount --> CheckPayment : User applies/skips promo & proceeds\nVM calls coordinator.showPayment\nRouter appends .payment(order, discount)
    CheckPayment --> CheckReceipt : Payment succeeds\nVM calls coordinator.showSuccess\nRouter appends .success(result)
    CheckReceipt --> CheckRoot : User taps "Done"\nReceiptView triggers finishCheckout()\nRouter calls popToRoot() (path = NavigationPath())

    CheckPayment --> CheckDiscount : User taps Back button\nSwiftUI removes .payment from path
    CheckDiscount --> CheckRoot : User taps Back button\nSwiftUI removes .discount from path
}

' Cross-Feature Navigation Transition
CatDetail --> CheckDiscount : **Cross-Feature Transition:**\n1. User taps "Add to Cart & Checkout"\n2. CatCoord calls delegate?.catalogDidSelectProductForCheckout(product)\n3. AppCoord creates Order from Product\n4. AppCoord sets selectedTab = .checkout\n5. AppCoord calls CheckCoord.showDiscount(for: order)\n6. CheckRouter appends .discount(order)

@enduml
